\section{Identifiers}{

INE's identifier columns are year-suffixed and inconsistent
(\code{DTCC91}, \code{DTMN21}, \code{FR11}, ...). Year-stable tidy columns are added
alongside the originals: \code{censos_year}, \code{bgri} (full subsecção code),
\code{dtmn}, \code{dtmnfr}, \code{seccao}, \code{subseccao}, and — where the file carries
them (1991–2011) — \code{lugar}/\code{lugar_nome}. GIS artifacts (\code{OBJECTID},
\verb{SHAPE_*}) and INE join metadata are dropped.

